WEBVTT

00:00:09,230 --> 00:00:13,710
is horrible replacement therapy, BHRT.

00:00:13,710 --> 00:00:18,070
So BHRT stands for bioidentical formal replacement therapy.

00:00:18,070 --> 00:00:20,870
Is this bad if you've had breast cancer?

00:00:20,870 --> 00:00:24,670
Well, bioidentical formal replacement therapy,

00:00:24,670 --> 00:00:28,310
there is a non-bioidentical formal replacement therapy.

00:00:28,310 --> 00:00:31,790
So if you just went to your medical doctor and asked

00:00:31,790 --> 00:00:34,430
for formal replacement therapy,

00:00:35,150 --> 00:00:39,430
there's a lot of medication market that are not bioidentical

00:00:39,430 --> 00:00:45,430
hormones, and they can be extremely dangerous.

00:00:45,430 --> 00:00:48,310
I'm very much against it.

00:00:48,310 --> 00:00:49,310
I don't even know.

00:00:49,310 --> 00:00:53,150
There's that many doctors that prescribe that anymore.

00:00:53,150 --> 00:00:59,630
It just increases the risk of cancers of hormone-driven cancers

00:00:59,630 --> 00:01:01,790
to immensely.

00:01:01,870 --> 00:01:07,510
So I don't personally, I haven't heard anybody taking that

00:01:07,510 --> 00:01:11,870
for a while, though I'm sure it's prescribed on a daily basis.

00:01:11,870 --> 00:01:14,430
Bioidentical formal replacement therapy

00:01:14,430 --> 00:01:16,670
is kind of taking the place of that.

00:01:16,670 --> 00:01:20,430
It's said to be more natural, and it is.

00:01:20,430 --> 00:01:26,230
It's a much healthier substitute for the medication

00:01:26,230 --> 00:01:27,750
formal replacement therapy.

00:01:27,750 --> 00:01:30,830
But the negative is that you still have

00:01:30,830 --> 00:01:35,190
to really be careful if you have a formal driven cancer.

00:01:35,190 --> 00:01:38,510
Even if you had breast cancer that was triple negative,

00:01:38,510 --> 00:01:41,150
I still wouldn't be an advocate of using a formal

00:01:41,150 --> 00:01:44,470
replacement therapy bioidentical, even.

00:01:44,470 --> 00:01:45,750
It's not to be really careful.

00:01:45,750 --> 00:01:47,750
The thing to do is to run a Dutch test,

00:01:47,750 --> 00:01:51,310
and you'd have to keep an eye on that on a very regular basis

00:01:51,310 --> 00:01:52,590
if you're going to do that.

00:01:52,590 --> 00:01:55,710
Now, there's times where using bioidenticals

00:01:55,710 --> 00:01:59,870
can be beneficial using some progesterone,

00:01:59,870 --> 00:02:01,630
or using some testosterone.

00:02:01,630 --> 00:02:04,630
You'd have to be more careful with the esterones

00:02:04,630 --> 00:02:09,110
because of even if you have triple negative breast cancer,

00:02:09,110 --> 00:02:11,230
because it is the bad estrogen,

00:02:11,230 --> 00:02:14,030
you're going to be, if you're taking an estrogen,

00:02:14,030 --> 00:02:17,030
the chance that it's going to occur,

00:02:17,030 --> 00:02:19,390
you only one step away of it breaking down

00:02:19,390 --> 00:02:24,390
into four hydroxyestero, which is the more dangerous estrogen.

00:02:25,390 --> 00:02:30,430
You'd also want to look at your COMT genes as well,

00:02:30,430 --> 00:02:33,110
because if you have defects on your COMT genes

00:02:33,110 --> 00:02:36,110
and about a fan of doing a bioidentical

00:02:36,110 --> 00:02:38,150
hormone replacement therapy and all,

00:02:38,150 --> 00:02:41,910
because you do increase your risk for a breast cancer,

00:02:41,910 --> 00:02:45,310
even if you haven't had a diagnosis.

00:02:45,310 --> 00:02:48,750
So it's something you want to be careful with,

00:02:48,750 --> 00:02:51,910
but there's a lot of doctors, especially on the West Coast

00:02:51,950 --> 00:02:56,950
that are really big to doing bioidentical foremodes,

00:02:56,950 --> 00:03:01,590
and it's very common to keep a person feeling younger

00:03:01,590 --> 00:03:03,310
in many ways.

00:03:03,310 --> 00:03:05,350
And I'm not saying that it doesn't have benefits,

00:03:05,350 --> 00:03:07,230
but it also has risks.

